# Cursor AI Rules — Benaqaab India

# You must strictly follow all directives in AGENTS.md at the workspace root:
# 1. ANTI-DUMP LAW: Do not load full mega-files (BENAQAAB_AI_AGENT_MASTER_SKILL.md, MASTER_VIDEO_GENERATION_SKILLS.md, MEMORY.md) into context.
# 2. ITERATIVE SURGICAL READING: Use targeted file inspection with line numbers. Return as many times as needed to understand before acting.
# 3. OPUS 5.5 VIDEO STANDARD: Pure code deterministic rendering (seek(t)), continuous acceleration cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), 3-scale motion, zero dead frames, and the 5 Forensic Primitives.
# 4. BEST THING DONE: Zero AI slop, full broadcast finish, 1-Gate Approval Pipeline (comp.html preview first).
# 5. FORMAT & DURATION GATE: Whenever a topic is chosen, ALWAYS ask the user: (1) Long video (16:9), short video, or YouTube Short (9:16)? and (2) What target duration? Wait for confirmation!
# 6. VISUAL DENSITY & GLOWING IMAGES: Minimum 10 AI images/min for long-form (5m = 50+ images; 10m = 100+ images) and minimum 30 images for Shorts/Reels (1 cut every 1.5-2s). Enable specular rim glows and volumetric bloom. Think intentionally—pair every visual causally with the voiceover!
# 7. REAL SOURCE PROOF FOR EVERYTHING SPOKEN: Every fact, number, or claim spoken must have supporting real media from the web (newspapers, gazettes, court filings, balance sheets, videos, satellite maps). Never speak without visible proof!
# 8. THE "WHY WATCH THIS FULL VIDEO" HOOK: In the first 3-5s (Frame 0 to 5s), plant the high-stakes burning question—why watch till the end, what shocking reality is revealed, and what is at stake for the viewer personally.
# 9. DYNAMIC MOTION GRAPHICS & HIGHLIGHTING: Never leave media static. Actively sweep yellow highlighter (multiply), zoom with 2.5x forensic loupe, drop animated callout pins with leader lines, roll metric odometers, and slam verdict stamps.
# 10. WORLDWIDE EXHAUSTIVE DEEP RESEARCH: Autonomously research across global and domestic registries, connecting all direct and indirect dots (root cause, international geopolitics, money trail, supply chain, citizen impact).

Refer to AGENTS.md for full details.
